  "description": "<div><span>⭐</span> <em>After inspiring over 2 million visitors worldwide, </em><strong><em>House of Dreamers</em></strong><em> arrives in London for the very first time. Step into a first-of-its-kind immersive exhibition by Elena &amp; Giulia Sella, featuring 16 breathtaking installations designed to awaken your imagination, stir your emotions and celebrate the power of dreams.</em></div><div><br></div><div><span>🔓</span><strong><em>Doors open to the public! Get your tickets now!</em></strong></div><div><br></div><div><strong>Highlights</strong></div><div><span>🌈</span><strong> 16 Immersive Dreamscapes: </strong>Journey through a series of whimsical, pastel-drenched installations designed to spark wonder and ignite your imagination.</div><div><span><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/emoji-datasource-apple/img/apple/64/1fae7.png\" alt=\"bubbles emoji\"></span><strong> Giant Pink Ball Pit:</strong> Dive into a massive, vibrant pink pool, the ultimate photo-ready experience designed to help you find joy in the present moment.</div><div><span>🍄</span><strong> Fairytale Forest &amp; Cloud Swings:</strong> Wander through kaleidoscopic toadstools, discover light-projected waterfalls, and literally swing among ethereal white clouds.</div><div><span>🤖</span><strong> Cutting-Edge Interactive Tech: </strong>Use the 'Dream Machine' or watch your own animal sketches come to life and roam through magical digital landscapes.</div><div><span>👪</span> <strong>Families are welcome:</strong> free add-on ticket available for Toddlers (0-3 y.o.)</div><div><span>🎁</span> Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for House of Dreamers <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/650247\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><strong>General Info</strong></div><div><br></div><div><strong><em>Please note - ﻿If you arrive late for your booking you may be refused entry.</em></strong></div><div><br></div><div><span>📅</span> Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector</div><div><span>🕒</span> Time:&nbsp;</div><div>- Monday–Thursday: 10 AM–7 PM</div><div>- Friday &amp; Public Holidays: 10 AM–8 PM</div><div>- Saturday: 9 AM–8 PM</div><div>- Sunday: 10 AM–7 PM</div><div><span>⏲</span> Please note that last slot begins 75 minutes before closing time</div><div><span>⏳</span> Duration: 60-90 minutes&nbsp;</div><div><span>📍</span> Location: Immerse LDN, Excel Waterfront</div><div><span>🚗</span> Parking is available on-site and can be booked in advance <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://excellondon.aeroparker.com/book/EXCEL/Parking?parkingCmd=collectParkingDetails\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a></div><div><span>👤</span> Age requirement: all ages are welcome! - Children must be accompanied by a paying adult</div><div><span>🧦</span> Please bear in mind that socks need to be worn in the ball pit</div><div><span>🧥</span> Lockers available on-site</div><div><span>❗</span>Toddler / Carer tickets - Free tickets must still be added to your basket for our headcount and for health &amp; safety requirements.</div><div><span>♿</span> Accessibility: the exhibition route is accessible for wheelchair users and visitors with reduced mobility. However, due to the nature of some installations, certain areas may be less suitable for guests with specific access requirements</div><div><span>👯</span> Booking form for groups of 5-19 people available <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://groups.feverup.com/en/?id=152290&amp;exp=House+of+Dreamers+&amp;bt=large_group&amp;cp_landing=cta_experience&amp;cp_landing_term=cta_experience&amp;cp_landing_source=tickets.houseofdreamers&amp;utm_source=direct&amp;utm_campaign=152290-House+of+Dreamers+-large_group\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a></div><div><span>❓</span> Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://tickets.houseofdreamers.com/#faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a></div><div><br></div><div><strong>Description</strong></div><div><em>House of Dreamers</em> is an immersive journey into your own dreams. Guests of all ages are invited on an extraordinary journey through 16 immersive installations, brought to life through exclusive DreamBand and AI-powered technology. As you explore, your DreamBand unlocks magical touchpoints along the way, revealing personalised, interactive moments designed to make your experience even more meaningful, memorable, and truly unique. Begin your journey towards making your greatest dreams come true… and remember, everything starts with a dream.</div>",
